# Portal import

## Classification
- AO3: publisher "Archive of Our Own" and/or `archiveofourown.org/works/{id}`
- Ficbook: `ficbook.net` in rights/title page
- Else: Other → Other shelf

## AO3 EPUB
- Primary: preface fields Fandom, Relationships, Summary
- `/` = romantic pairing, `&` = platonic
- Do not treat flat OPF `dc:subject` as typed primary source
- Fixture: `Next_Best_Thing.epub`

## Ficbook EPUB
- Primary: `title.xhtml` labels «Фэндом», «Пэйринг и персонажи», description
- Fixture: any of the three ficbook sample EPUBs

## Damaged AO3 FB2
- Best-effort body header / ao3 URLs; never crash import
- Do not trust title-info when author is translator placeholder
